// Whose state each country is on 1 January 2024.
//
// `primary_cultures` are the peoples a country is for. Everyone else living in it is a
// minority of it, which is what assimilation works on and what radicalises a region when its
// people are governed by somebody they are not. Who lives where is not here: every region
// writes its own peoples in history/states/2024/, and a region that writes none is taken to
// be the first of these.
//
// A country founded in a campaign declares its own when it is proclaimed (common/formables,
// and secession names the people that left). A mod changes one country by naming it again in
// a later file; history/pops/ is still read for mods written before this moved here.
